    }"},{"id":"ch-array-58","title":"数组类型","url":"https://github.com/cangjielanguage/cangjie_docs/blob/f8f8cd75a336e23785a4c57bd6091b2adf1e0302/docs/dev-guide/source_zh_cn/basic_data_type/array.md#L58-L137","text":"```cangjie
